pixel frequency with a vertical refresh rate of 70 Hz.

There are two jumpers that need to be set:

  1) VGAEN  VGA enable
  2) Alias

For an EV4 processor, the Alias jumper must be open, not installed. The VGAEN
jumper is installed on the first PBXGB card, and not installed/removed from
any subsequent PBXGB cards.

For an EV5 processor, the Alias jumper is always installed.

