From the digital Systems & Options Catalog October-December 1983, page 3-2:

"Two VAX 11/730 systems are currently available, with a choice of mass
storage devices.
Each system includes the following:

VAX 11/730 Central Processor Unit
- 1 MB ECC MOS main memory (64K chip) expandable to 5 MB
- VAX 11/730 Integrated disk controller
- One DMF32-LP
- Dual TU58 tape crtridge drives
.... "

Page 3-5 lists the SV-CXMMA-CA (CD) system backplane lay-out:

1 RB730 disk controller
2 reserved for FP730
3 data path
4 memory controller
5 writable control store
6 MS730-CA
7 reserved for MS730-CA
8 reserved for MS730-CA
9 reserved for MS730-CA
10 reserved for MS730-CA or TU80
11 DMF32-LP
12 terminator | quad slot

Hans





